 {"exp",688,132,"A gleam of light came straight though the opening, and then there was a loud crack. A hole appeared suddenly about three feet off the ground. Thorin put the key from his grandfather's map into the hole. It fitted and turned! A door five feet high and three broad was outlined, and slowly swung inwards.\nOld Side Door","","The Path of the Company\nExplorer of the Dale-lands","","1879366159\n1879366146"},
