 {"exp",699,438,"None of the men from Lake-town would stay with them even for a night so near the shadow of the Mountain.","","The Path of the Company","","1879366159"},
 {"exp",430,439,"Gwígar","","Explorer of Eryn Lasgalen","","1879366144"},
 {"exp",810,453,"Urûshoba","","Ruins of the North","","1879366154"},
 {"exp",493,454,"Somehow the killing of the giant spider, all alone by himself in the dark without the help of anyone else, made a great difference to Mr. Baggins. He felt a different person.","","The Path of the Company","","1879366159"},
 {"exp",484,455,"He beat the creature off with his hands, until he remembered his sword!\nImnagath","","The Path of the Company\nExplorer of Eryn Lasgalen","","1879366159\n1879366144"},
 {"exp",466,477,"They saw a gathering of Elves feasting. They ran towards them to beg for food, but as soon as they approached, the Elves vanished!","","The Path of the Company","","1879366159"},
 {"exp",704,478,"Lake-town","Ciudad del Lago","Explorer of the Dale-lands","","1879366146"},
 {"exp",796,486,"Stranding","","Ruins of the North","","1879366154"},
 {"exp",469,487,"He saw all around him a sea of dark green, and hundreds of black butterflies.","","The Path of the Company","","1879366159"},
 {"exp",634,488,"Dwarf-marker 2","Marcador enano","Surveyor of the Dwarf-markers","","1879366160"},
 {"exp",418,490,"Bombur slept for days, and dreamt of great Elvish feasts. His memory of their adventures thus far were gone.","","The Path of the Company","","1879366159"},
 {"exp",222,506,"Well, it was not true that they could see nothing: they could see eyes!","","The Path of the Company","","1879366159"},
 {"exp",591,511,"The Elves were making a raft of the barrels, with the dwarves still inside, and would soon be steering it downstream to Lake-town.","","The Path of the Company","","1879366159"},
 {"exp",137,516,"'O good-bye and go away!' grunted the dwarves, who were secretly filled with dismay at losing him.\nThe Forest Gate","","The Path of the Company\nExplorer of Eryn Lasgalen","","1879366159\n1879366144"},
 {"exp",518,522,"Tham Aeldír","","Ruins of the North","","1879366154"},
 {"exp",665,551,"Esgaroth-of-old\nMany of the Lake-men took up song, and it rolled loud and high over the Lake.\nThe Bones of Smaug","","Explorer of the Dale-lands\nThe Path of the Company\nExplorer of the Dale-lands","","1879366146\n1879366159\n1879366146"},
 {"exp",603,551,"Loeglond","","Explorer of Eryn Lasgalen","","1879366144"},
 {"exp",642,569,"'If you want to go on with this silly adventure, you had better slap your arms and rub your legs and try and help me get the others out while there is a chance!'","","The Path of the Company","","1879366159"},
